        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Wyndorf, Poly Styrene, Marianne Joan Elliott-Said, David Albert Wyndorf\n- Bands and Music Releases: Monster Magnet, X-Ray Spex, Love Monster\n- Roles: songwriter, lead vocalist, guitarist, musician, singer-songwriter, frontwoman\n\nFacts:\n- David Albert Wyndorf was born on October 28, 1956.\n- Marianne Joan Elliott-Said was born on July 3, 1957, and later became known by the stage name Poly Styrene.\n- Dave Wyndorf is the songwriter, lead vocalist, and a guitarist for the American rock group Monster Magnet.\n- In 1988, Dave Wyndorf recorded all songs on the EP Love Monster a year before Monster Magnet was formed.\n- Poly Styrene was a British musician, singer-songwriter, and frontwoman for the punk rock band X-Ray Spex.\n- Marianne Joan Elliott-Said died on April 25, 2011.",
